# vhs docs/demo.tape → docs/demo.gif
# Regenerate after CLI-facing changes. Uses only the built-in example person.
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 900
Set Height 520
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Type "life-chart --example"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "life-chart --example --json | head -20"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
